==Essential improvements==
===[https://www.mulderland.com/games/doom-3 Mulderland's Enhancement Pack]===
{{ii}} An automated, open-source installer based on NSIS.
* Installs the [[#Source_ports|dhewm3 source port]] along with its Wide Patches.
* Can install [[#The_Lost_Mission|The Lost Mission]] if Resurrection of Evil is detected and installed.
* Can install GrowlingGuy41's upscaled textures pack.
{{++}} Includes an UI that allows partial activation of the Wide Patches (per game/DLC), as they are not compatible with existing savegames.
{{++}} dhewm3 is installed in a way that remains compatible with Steam Overlay, Game Time Tracking, and other Steam features.

