{{Fixbox|description=Set widescreen manually|ref=<ref>{{Refurl|url=https://www.wsgf.org/dr/doom-3|title=Doom 3 &#124; WSGF|date=2025-07-01}}</ref>|fix=
<ol><li>Update the game to the [[#Patches|latest version]].
<li>Create and open {{file|{{p|game}}\base\autoexec.cfg}}.
<li>Add the following commands.
<pre>
seta r_customWidth 1920
seta r_customHeight 1080
seta r_mode -1
seta r_aspectRatio 1</pre>
<li>Set <code>seta r_customWidth</code> and <code>seta r_customHeight</code> to the desired resolution width and height.
<li>Set <code>seta r_aspectRatio</code> to {{code|1}} for 16:9 or 21:9 resolutions, {{code|2}} for 16:10 or 15:9, or {{code|0}} for 4:3.
</ol>
'''Notes'''
{{ii}} For 21:9 and wider, apply the fixes for [https://community.pcgamingwiki.com/files/file/1477-doom-3-fov-fixes/ Doom 3] and [https://community.pcgamingwiki.com/files/file/2480-doom-3-resurrection-of-evil-aspect-ratio-219-fov-fix/ Resurrection of Evil].</ol>
}}

