===Micro stuttering===
{{ii}} This issue is caused by playing the game on a 60 Hz display, while the game's internal ticrate being tied to a 62.5 frame rate cap. Users playing the game on a high refresh rate displays (e.g. 120 Hz, 144 Hz) would not experience this problem.

{{Fixbox|description=Try [[#High frame rate|variable frame rate fix]]|ref={{cn|date=July 2025}}|fix=
}}
{{Fixbox|description=Unlock the game's frame rate and cap it externally|ref=<ref>{{Refurl|url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=891278647|title=Micro Stutter Fix [Working 2020] - Steam Community Guides|date=2024-06-08}}</ref><ref>{{Refcheck|user=Cosmiccube047|date=2024-06-08}}</ref>|fix=
<ol><li>Create and open {{file|{{p|game}}\base\autoexec.cfg}}.
<li>Add the following commands.
<pre>seta com_precisetic "0"
seta com_FixedTic "1"
seta r_swapInterval "0"</pre>
<li>[[Glossary:Frame_rate_(FPS)#Frame_rate_capping|Cap the frame rate at 60 FPS]].</ol>
}}

===Visual twitch bug with OpenAL/EAX===
